{"unit_id":"asdshuaishuai__websearch-plugins#card-zh","repo":"asdshuaishuai/websearch-plugins","commit":"45f53528f2d317312d0765e89d9e6aec3f0be793","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"websearch-plugins（DSH 网页客户端插件）：为 DSH 的 web 能力接入网页搜索和网址抓取。它向 ctx.web 注册 16 个国内外搜索引擎、聚合搜索 provider 和直接抓取 provider，并由 bundle 默认选择聚合搜索、启用 web_fetch。主要功能包括并行汇总搜索结果、过滤失败引擎、跨引擎去重排序、按需用无头 Chromium 渲染页面，以及抓取指定网址并限制响应体大小。适合需要从 DSH 查询多个搜索源或读取网页内容的用户。无需 API key；可选需要本机已有 Chrome/Chromium 才能使用渲染回退。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:93","lib/search.js:97","lib/fetch.js:28","cordis.patch.yml:14"]}
{"unit_id":"asdshuaishuai__websearch-plugins#card-en","repo":"asdshuaishuai/websearch-plugins","commit":"45f53528f2d317312d0765e89d9e6aec3f0be793","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"websearch-plugins (DSH web plugin) adds aggregated search and URL fetching. It registers 16 search engines, combines and deduplicates results, and provides web_fetch with bounded responses. Optional headless Chrome renders JS pages. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:93","lib/search.js:97","lib/fetch.js:28","cordis.patch.yml:14"]}
