{"unit_id":"asdshuaishuai__websearch-plugins#feature-1","repo":"asdshuaishuai/websearch-plugins","commit":"45f53528f2d317312d0765e89d9e6aec3f0be793","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"websearch-plugins 的功能「聚合网页搜索」：并行请求已选的搜索引擎，过滤异常或空结果，再按规范化 URL 去重并交错汇总。通过 web_search 调用，输入查询和可选结果数，返回来源列表与状态摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/search.js:109","lib/search.js:143","lib/search.js:153"]}
{"unit_id":"asdshuaishuai__websearch-plugins#feature-2","repo":"asdshuaishuai/websearch-plugins","commit":"45f53528f2d317312d0765e89d9e6aec3f0be793","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"websearch-plugins 的功能「单引擎搜索」：为注册的每个搜索引擎提供独立 provider，可由 DSH 的 web 配置选择。输入查询并可指定返回条数，输出解析和清理后的网页标题、链接及摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:96","lib/search.js:31","lib/search.js:43"]}
